[iterm2-material-design](https://github.com/MartinSeeler/iterm2-material-design)
* Clone the repo or download the file material-design-colors.itermcolors
* iTerm2 > Preferences > Profiles > Colors Tab
* Click Color Presets...
* Click Import...
* Select the material-design-colors.itermcolors file
* Select the material-design-colors from Load Presets...
